WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.543
Your business shouldn't depend on you to keep
everything moving.

00:00:03.553 --> 00:00:05.529
That's why you have me.

00:00:05.539 --> 00:00:07.097
I'm STORM.

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:10.396
While you and your team are busy running the
business,

00:00:10.396 --> 00:00:14.671
I keep watch across the systems you already
use—looking for what needs attention,

00:00:14.671 --> 00:00:18.617
what might be overlooked, and where there's
an opportunity to move forward.

00:00:18.627 --> 00:00:20.516
Here's an example.

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:24.058
A customer case is marked closed in
Salesforce.

00:00:24.068 --> 00:00:25.762
That's great.

00:00:25.772 --> 00:00:28.850
But was the customer actually taken care of?

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.098
I look beyond the status, identify what's
still unresolved,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.977
and help get it to the right person.

00:00:34.987 --> 00:00:39.083
Over in Dynamics, a request is waiting
between departments.

00:00:39.093 --> 00:00:44.086
Rather than letting it sit, I help clarify
who's responsible, what needs approval,

00:00:44.086 --> 00:00:46.007
and what should happen next.

00:00:46.017 --> 00:00:48.666
Oh, and I'm in HubSpot too.

00:00:48.676 --> 00:00:51.987
I notice an opportunity that's ready for
attention.

00:00:51.997 --> 00:00:56.901
I bring it forward, recommend the next step,
and help the team follow through.

00:00:56.911 --> 00:00:58.801
Different systems.

00:00:58.811 --> 00:01:00.602
Different teams.

00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:03.139
One standard of accountability.

00:01:03.149 --> 00:01:05.480
But here's what really matters.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:08.887
I don't stop when something gets assigned or
marked done.

00:01:08.897 --> 00:01:11.392
I help track what happened, whether it
worked,

00:01:11.392 --> 00:01:13.887
and what the business can learn from it.

00:01:13.897 --> 00:01:20.289
And when a bigger fix is needed, I help build
a 15, 30, 60, or 90 day action plan,

00:01:20.289 --> 00:01:22.980
so the same problem doesn't keep coming back.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:24.953
Why do I do this?

00:01:24.963 --> 00:01:29.806
So you can spend less time chasing the work
and more time moving your business forward.

00:01:29.816 --> 00:01:31.472
EA STORM.

00:01:31.482 --> 00:01:33.590
Keep What Matters Moving.

